    "turn_text": "much deeper and longer conversation because I know that you need to go and you're always someone who I know I can turn to for a direct and honest conversation about this. I hope we can do that again in the future. I'll end our conversation today though with one final curiosity. You did something which I think needs to be done more. He went on an ideological opponent show. He went on Joy Reid's MSNBC show. All I really want to ask you is what was it like when the cameras went off? What was it? What was it? Was it friendly? Was it cordial? I just had Stephen A Smith on the podcast again. We're friends and we didn't fake it. It wasn't fake. But when the cameras went off, we were respectful because we were men and we understood disagreement. What was it like there with Joy Reid? Oh, we argued",
